---
import Container from "./Container.astro";
---

<Container>
  <section id="philosophy" class="mt-24 sm:mt-32">
    <div class="border-t-1 my-8 text-white/10"/>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-4 sm:grid sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-y-0 sm:items-end">
      <div>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs text-white/60 "><span class="text-brand">02</span> - PHILOSOPHY</p>
        <p class="font-display font-bold text-4xl lg:text-[3rem]">How we build</p>
      </div>
        <p class="font-sans text-sm text-white/60 sm:text-right">Real problems, made simple.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12">
      <p class="font-display text-3xl lg:text-[2.5rem] leading-tight lg:leading-none">We build apps and <br/> devices that take on <span class="text-brand">real <br/> problems</span> and make the <br/> hard part disappear — <span class="text-white/30">so <br/> you only think about what <br/> matters.</span></p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 lg:mt-20 grid grid-cols-1 gap-y-8 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-y-0 border-1 border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 gap-x-4">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brand">01</p>
        <p class="font-sans font-bold text-lg">Focus over features</p>
        <p class="font-display text-sm text-white/60">Every product does one thing genuinely well. <br/> We cut everything that gets between you and <br/> the result.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brand">02</p>
        <p class="font-sans font-bold text-lg">The hard part is ours</p>
        <p class="font-display text-sm text-white/60">The complexity lives inside the product, not in <br/> front of you. You bring the intent; we handle the <br/> work.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-2">
        <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brand">03</p>
        <p class="font-sans font-bold text-lg">Shipped with care</p>
        <p class="font-display text-sm text-white/60">Indie doesn't mean unfinished. Details, polish <br/> and reliability are the whole point.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </section>
</Container>
